            "notes": "Checks the status and capacity usage of all storage pools on a Huawei OceanStor Pacific storage system via the REST API (/data_service/storagepool endpoint). Alerts when a pool reports a non-normal status and when its used capacity reaches the warning or critical threshold. Supports extended reporting via --lengthy.",
